        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF150 CSSFontFaceRule.style is a CSSFontFaceDescriptors]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29365</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29365"/>
        <updated>2026-03-30T06:15:17.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF150 added support for <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSFontFaceRule" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">CSSFontFaceRule.style</code></a>   being a <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSFontFaceDescriptors" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">CSSFontFaceDescriptors</code></a> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2019904" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2019904</a></p>
<p dir="auto">The <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4143791881" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29352" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29352/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29352">#29352</a> caught all the updates for creation of the <code class="notranslate">CSSFontFaceDescriptors</code> but missed the <code class="notranslate">CSSFontFaceRule.style</code> that owns it.<br>
This updates the feature.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4127864131" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43564" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43564/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43564">mdn/content#43564</a></p>]]></content>
