        <title type="html"><![CDATA[fix(lint): prefer MDN pages with single browser-compat value]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29341</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29341"/>
        <updated>2026-03-27T17:08:24.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Update the <code class="notranslate">mdn-urls</code> linter rules</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Ignore overview pages (with <code class="notranslate">browser-compat</code> front matter).</li>
<li>Prefer pages with single <code class="notranslate">browser-compat</code> value.</li>
</ul>
